  pauseKey: 27
  missionHelp: Mine 3 Timber at the House forecourt and 2 Stone at the Cave forecourt.
    Read both stations, then follow the central lane north. Ctrl precise + G includes
    faded solids; Q/E exposes a forward side face. RMB-build amber Timber cells in
    order, walk across, then build cyan Stone steps and jump up. F activates at the
    relay; R returns to camp. Manual F5 saves, F9 loads, F8 loads previous. Journal
    is session-only. Each new generated scene has its own slot. This standalone review
    opens directly; quit normally to leave.
  pausedMessage: Paused / Controls
  focusMessage: Focus lost / Paused
  selectionScenePath: 
  returnUnavailableMessage: Selection scene unavailable; expedition kept paused.
