    forecourts. Repair the north relay approach and survey its upper mark.
  repairObjective: Match 3 Timber crossing cells and 2 Stone steps. Mine mistakes
    to refund.
  returnObjective: Stand on the upper relay mark and press F to connect the stations.
  completeObjective: Shelter relay connected. The generated frontier remains yours
    to explore and build. F6 resets field notes only.
