  missingSurveyMessage: Read both shelter stations and the relay mark first.
  missingRepairMessage: Restore every amber Timber cell and cyan Stone step.
  alreadyActiveMessage: Signal already active. Keep exploring or press F6 to replay.
  returnMessage: Climb to the upper relay mark, then press F.
  successMessage: Shelter relay connected. Explore freely; manual snapshots remain
    available.
  restartMessage: Field notes restarted. Construction, stockpile and snapshots remain.
